## Phase III (2 weeks): Synergetics

Read Hermann Haken.

Especially

**Synergetics**

Key ideas:

Order parameters

Slaving principle

Instability

Collective variables

The slaving principle says

[
\text{many microscopic degrees of freedom}
\rightarrow
\text{few mesoscopic variables}.
]

This may become a central conceptual bridge to economics.

